{"3088070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Light: Survivor", "steam_appid": 3088070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Deck Compatibility</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088070/extras/36224990f2251edb05ebd2583ff3446f.avif?t=1785723576\" alt=\"Steam Deck Verified\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088070/extras_big/36224990f2251edb05ebd2583ff3446f.avif?t=1785723576 width=1560 height=270 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join us on Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Light: Survivor is a dark sci-fi survivor-like action roguelike that blends bullet heaven chaos, ARPG loot, and third-person shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch anytime between top-down survival combat and TPS action as you board the Phantom Train, humanity’s last hope for escaping the Dark Void. Journey through a shattered multiverse, fight endless horrors, loot deadly weapons, and create powerful builds as one of the last Dark Hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world brings new enemies, bosses, weapons, and choices. Push deeper into the darkness, uncover the path to Elysium, and survive long enough to keep humanity’s final dream alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch camera. Loot hard. Survive the Dark Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Perspective Shifts:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between top down and third person view at any time. Command the battlefield from above or move in close for immersive combat, precise aiming, and devastating headshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fight for survival. Gather resources, unlock permanent upgrades, discover powerful new weapons and items, and push deeper into increasingly brutal worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Biomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross three deadly worlds, a ruined town consumed by demons and cybernetic horrors, cursed castle ruins swallowed by the Dark Void, and a frozen battlefield where giant insect beasts roam among the wreckage of ancient warships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts and Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 3 unique classes, each with distinct skills, strengths, and upgrade paths. Unlock Artifacts, earn permanent bonuses, and build your loadout with new starting weapons and abilities every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Mode &amp; Cinematic Graphics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between cinematic 4K visuals and a nostalgic Pixel Mode that evokes classic indie games. Pixel Mode isn’t just a visual change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Light: Survivor is a dark sci-fi survivor-like action roguelike that blends bullet heaven chaos, ARPG loot, and third-person shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch anytime between top-down survival combat and TPS action as you board the Phantom Train, humanity’s last hope for escaping the Dark Void. Journey through a shattered multiverse, fight endless horrors, loot deadly weapons, and create powerful builds as one of the last Dark Hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world brings new enemies, bosses, weapons, and choices. Push deeper into the darkness, uncover the path to Elysium, and survive long enough to keep humanity’s final dream alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch camera. Loot hard. Survive the Dark Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Perspective Shifts:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between top down and third person view at any time. Command the battlefield from above or move in close for immersive combat, precise aiming, and devastating headshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fight for survival. Gather resources, unlock permanent upgrades, discover powerful new weapons and items, and push deeper into increasingly brutal worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Biomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross three deadly worlds, a ruined town consumed by demons and cybernetic horrors, cursed castle ruins swallowed by the Dark Void, and a frozen battlefield where giant insect beasts roam among the wreckage of ancient warships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts and Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 3 unique classes, each with distinct skills, strengths, and upgrade paths. Unlock Artifacts, earn permanent bonuses, and build your loadout with new starting weapons and abilities every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Mode &amp; Cinematic Graphics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between cinematic 4K visuals and a nostalgic Pixel Mode that evokes classic indie games. Pixel Mode isn’t just a visual change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dark Light: Survivor is a dark sci-fi action roguelike with ARPG loot and third-person shooter combat. Switch anytime between top-down view and TPS aiming as you build weapons, skills, and classes across brutal multiverse runs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088070/67fac2154cb1277ad161f57425efe8585bfd85ce/header.jpg?t=1785723576", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088070/a6d69dbed6069f056a40abfe98707acd85ac0e4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785723576", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088070/a6d69dbed6069f056a40abfe98707acd85ac0e4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785723576", "website": "https://www.darklight-game.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-5820K CPU @ 3.30GHz  or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 2070 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-5820K CPU @ 3.30GHz  or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 o